<title>EGYPT: Interbank Egyptian pound averages 3.3884/3.3914.</title>
<headline>Interbank Egyptian pound averages 3.3884/3.3914.</headline>
<dateline>CAIRO 1997-03-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Private-sector Cairo banks quoted the dollar at 3.3850 to 3.3890 pounds bid and 3.3900 to 3.3925 pounds offered in the interbank market on Tuesday.</p>
<p>A survey of five actively trading banks gave average rates of 3.3884 pounds bid and 3.3914 pounds offered.</p>
<p>The Central Bank calculated the average exchange rate at midday (1000 GMT) at 3.391351 buy and 3.397479 sell.</p>
<p>-- Cairo newsroom +20 2 578 3290/1</p>
</text>
